{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在S10至S12等较短段落里，完整话句和多条感受仍然偏密，观众可能来不及逐条消化。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的重点词有明确的视觉落点，话语本身又保留了人物心理变化的因果关系，普通观众比较容易边听边抓住他为什么从坚定走向怀念、挣扎，再走向接纳。感受文字也不是简单堆放情绪标签，而是通过身体反应、声音、动作和意象呈现细微变化，并且部分感受按音乐时机出现，能让人感到情绪在发展。Y虽然短词较容易单独扫到，但右侧信息缺少优先级和时间层次，尤其S03、S06，许多不同阶段的感受挤在一起，反而不容易知道此刻究竟应该感受到什么。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e922ea3c-d31e-475c-8433-a64e19a09ec4", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T031643133062Z", "elapsed_seconds": 23.313, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T03:17:06.459959+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a4e6efceee41a4227fc5033ab953ab0d71fa67509c0a1c508419ece2f8439513", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\c